maker&#146;s average daily trading volume in our common stock during a specified <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">two-month</FONT> prior period or 200 shares of common stock, whichever is greater, and must be discontinued when that limit is reached;
and </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
