<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pro-rata</FONT> basis, real estate taxes and operating costs related to the premises. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The lease cost for
