three and nine months ended September 30, 2022, respectively, which is included in operating activities in the statement of operations. There were no amounts paid for operating lease liabilities during the three and nine months ended September 30,
2021, as the operating lease was not in effect at that time. </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">F-41 </P>

</DIV></Center>


